In-Reply-To: <20191211152831.23507-1-sashal@kernel.org>
References: <20191211152831.23507-1-sashal@kernel.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
X-stable: review
X-Patchwork-Hint: Ignore
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
Sender: linux-scsi-owner@vger.kernel.org
Precedence: bulk
